WEBVTT

01:42.760 --> 01:44.900
I can't run away.

01:45.200 --> 01:47.570
What's wrong with running away?!

01:47.570 --> 01:49.310
Running away is okay!

01:49.310 --> 01:51.870
No one will blame you!

01:54.310 --> 01:56.660
You can't! You have to stay here!

01:57.950 --> 01:59.120
Ichiko.

02:00.160 --> 02:01.720
Let her go.

02:02.950 --> 02:05.800
What are you saying, Suzume?! Yumemi is our-

02:06.200 --> 02:09.050
Ichiko, let's run again!

02:09.400 --> 02:12.810
Like we used to do when we were small, Yumemi, you and I.

02:17.130 --> 02:18.260
What's going on?

02:18.260 --> 02:19.520
Hidaka-san, are you okay?

02:21.200 --> 02:21.650
Yumemi?

02:23.330 --> 02:24.770
What's going on?

02:35.020 --> 02:36.120
Munto...

03:08.390 --> 03:09.550
Is this for real?

03:09.550 --> 03:11.690
This has to be a dream...

03:11.690 --> 03:13.420
Is this part of the Christmas event?

03:13.420 --> 03:15.460
Don't say stupid things!

03:15.460 --> 03:16.510
This is serious...

03:16.510 --> 03:19.140
I need to call home to check on my family...

03:22.630 --> 03:23.870
Yumemi, wait!

03:23.870 --> 03:24.910
Ichiko!

03:24.910 --> 03:27.510
Sacchi, you stay here with everyone else.

03:27.510 --> 03:28.770
I'm going after Yumemi.

03:28.770 --> 03:29.360
All right.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.410
Ichiko-san, I-

03:30.410 --> 03:31.850
You stay here too.

03:31.850 --> 03:32.840
Okay.

03:33.310 --> 03:35.970
Suzume, don't trip and fall.

03:37.890 --> 03:40.130
Ichiko, be careful!

03:52.860 --> 03:54.210
Don't tell me...

03:54.210 --> 03:57.870
...they want to use this thing to take Yumemi and her city away?

03:57.870 --> 03:59.370
If they do that...

04:00.200 --> 04:04.390
Yumemi's heart will reject it and create a collision of forces in the space-time continuum!

04:04.390 --> 04:08.330
Both worlds will be destroyed!

04:08.330 --> 04:11.380
Don't you get it, Gntarl?!

04:15.100 --> 04:16.850
The Magical King was spotted in the lower world!

04:17.050 --> 04:19.440
He's attacking Talon number one!

04:19.440 --> 04:21.850
What should we do, Your Excellency?

04:22.030 --> 04:24.910
He can't break my nails right now.

04:24.910 --> 04:28.140
Don't worry, lift it higher.

04:28.140 --> 04:29.860
All crew, enter battle positions!

04:48.640 --> 04:50.920
Suzume, are you all right?

04:50.920 --> 04:52.910
I'm all right, nyaa.

04:52.910 --> 04:54.010
Don't say "nyaa"!

04:54.010 --> 04:54.420
Nyaa.

05:29.580 --> 05:30.460
Munto...

06:10.860 --> 06:11.770
Munto!

06:34.050 --> 06:36.030
Suzume, what's wrong?

06:36.030 --> 06:36.440
Hurry-

06:42.590 --> 06:43.960
Let's hurry.

06:43.960 --> 06:44.720
Okay.

06:45.600 --> 06:47.430
Munto!

06:50.870 --> 06:51.750
Stay away...

06:55.450 --> 06:56.130
Munto!

06:56.670 --> 06:57.630
Stay away!

06:58.430 --> 07:00.130
Munto, I...

07:00.460 --> 07:01.390
Stay away!

07:02.370 --> 07:04.390
But if this continues...

07:04.820 --> 07:06.640
The Akuto has returned to the Heavens.

07:06.830 --> 07:08.400
You're useless now.

07:09.760 --> 07:12.040
Return to your own world.

07:12.040 --> 07:13.400
I'll take care of this on my own-

07:13.690 --> 07:14.690
Liar!

07:15.880 --> 07:20.770
I know because I can tell that this world is in danger...

07:20.770 --> 07:22.800
...and that you're suffering.

07:23.380 --> 07:24.700
Have you forgotten?

07:24.700 --> 07:28.840
Didn't you say you needed my strength before?

07:28.840 --> 07:31.940
You said the world would end if I didn't lend you my strength!

07:31.940 --> 07:33.710
You said I could do it!

07:37.750 --> 07:40.780
I want to help you.

07:40.780 --> 07:44.890
I want to continue living with Ichiko and Suzume!

07:45.360 --> 07:46.710
So please, Munto!

07:52.740 --> 07:55.270
Munto, answer me!

07:55.270 --> 07:56.090
Yumemi!

07:57.130 --> 07:59.480
Yumemi, don't! Come back!

08:00.010 --> 08:03.110
That's far enough! Don't go any further than that!

08:04.050 --> 08:05.030
Ichiko...

08:05.710 --> 08:06.640
I...

08:06.640 --> 08:07.490
No!

08:07.490 --> 08:10.100
Don't worry, I promise I'll come back.

08:10.100 --> 08:11.820
What do you mean you'll come back?

08:11.820 --> 08:13.500
Don't tell me you're really going to...

08:13.860 --> 08:17.000
If I don't go, our futures will disappear.

08:17.860 --> 08:19.590
You can't do this by yourself!

08:20.620 --> 08:22.290
That might be the case...

08:22.290 --> 08:27.590
But that summer, Suzume told
me that as long as I had courage,

08:27.590 --> 08:29.900
I'd be able to open up a new future!

08:29.900 --> 08:33.190
I want to protect your and Suzume's future!

08:33.580 --> 08:35.770
Yumemi, we can all protect it together...

08:36.280 --> 08:37.760
So for now...

08:40.450 --> 08:45.200
When I come back, the three of us should all have fun together. Okay, Ichiko?

08:45.880 --> 08:49.680
I want to go shopping once we get our paychecks.

08:49.680 --> 08:53.130
I found this store on the Internet that sells cute t-shirts.

08:53.130 --> 08:55.620
I've been wanting to tell you all about it.

08:55.620 --> 08:57.730
You'll come with me, right?

08:58.620 --> 09:01.340
Yumemi, why?

09:01.840 --> 09:06.330
You're always like this, looking up at the sky and running...

09:06.330 --> 09:08.230
I can't go there with you!

09:08.230 --> 09:10.790
I can't protect you there!

09:10.790 --> 09:11.770
Ichiko...

09:22.210 --> 09:22.940
Munto!

09:27.080 --> 09:30.700
As long as you have courage, you can open up a new future, huh?

09:31.210 --> 09:35.710
It seems this time it's my turn to believe in you.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.210
Munto...

09:38.960 --> 09:40.780
Come here, Yumemi.

09:44.900 --> 09:45.610
All right!

09:53.360 --> 09:54.310
Yumemi!

10:19.200 --> 10:21.030
This is...

10:21.030 --> 10:23.460
Space-time has merged!

10:23.780 --> 10:25.000
Why?

10:25.000 --> 10:27.510
Why does Munto have so much power?

10:28.160 --> 10:31.440
The main target - the girl who's the source of Akuto has appeared!

10:31.440 --> 10:31.960
She's directly below us!

10:45.370 --> 10:46.840
We can't ascend!

10:46.840 --> 10:49.230
Our ship is damaged and our thrust is decreasing!

10:49.230 --> 10:51.060
Our plan has failed.

10:51.060 --> 10:52.870
Your Excellency, we should...

10:54.300 --> 10:55.540
So this is...

10:55.940 --> 10:58.910
So this is the power of that girl?

11:07.540 --> 11:10.570
Thank goodness, everyone is all right.

11:10.570 --> 11:12.220
No, not yet.

11:12.600 --> 11:15.220
The future we opened has just begun.

11:17.240 --> 11:17.840
Yeah...

11:19.230 --> 11:20.850
Hold on tight.

11:35.840 --> 11:36.780
Yumemi...

13:23.880 --> 13:24.640
Munto!

13:24.900 --> 13:26.270
Lord Munto!

13:26.270 --> 13:27.350
He's back!

13:27.680 --> 13:30.110
Lady Ryuely, Lord Munto is back!

13:31.070 --> 13:33.860
Commander Leica, the gate of space and time has been opened.

13:34.070 --> 13:35.490
It's the Magical King.

13:35.730 --> 13:36.680
Munto?

13:48.840 --> 13:51.630
Blocks 7, 5 and 13 have been fully evacuated.

13:51.940 --> 13:54.120
Block 9: evacuated.

13:54.120 --> 13:57.730
Block 4 and bridge 2, prepared for evacuation.

13:58.880 --> 14:00.950
Your Excellency, please hurry.

14:00.950 --> 14:02.100
This ship is about to...

14:04.100 --> 14:06.680
That little girl...

14:23.400 --> 14:25.470
Yumemi, look.

14:28.180 --> 14:30.670
That hole was created when we ripped through the space-time continuum.

14:32.350 --> 14:35.420
We have to return before it closes.

14:36.730 --> 14:41.180
The light that's coming out of it is the bond that connects our worlds.

14:42.140 --> 14:45.510
To the world, it's just an ephemeral thread of light.

14:45.510 --> 14:47.570
However, it is our last hope.

14:48.260 --> 14:50.840
We have to turn the bond of that light into an entity.

14:50.840 --> 14:53.190
After it settles, we will then connect the two worlds.

14:56.040 --> 14:59.200
If we can achieve that, the cycle of Akuto will be restored.

14:59.780 --> 15:02.700
We will then be able to rescue both worlds from destruction.

15:03.310 --> 15:05.770
However, it won't be easy.

15:07.320 --> 15:09.920
If you can't believe in your own strength,

15:09.920 --> 15:13.080
then the light will fade, and everything will be lost.

15:15.460 --> 15:19.120
Our resolve will determine whether or not the future of our worlds will open or close.

15:20.370 --> 15:22.020
Listen up, Yumemi.

15:22.020 --> 15:23.810
Just remember these words:

15:24.840 --> 15:29.730
As long as we yearn for a tomorrow, the future will never close.

15:30.730 --> 15:34.480
As long as we don't give up, there is still hope.

15:36.430 --> 15:37.360
Can you do it?

15:41.100 --> 15:43.300
Regardless of what happens, we can't give up.

15:44.490 --> 15:47.480
All right, let's make some preparations beforehand.

15:55.200 --> 15:56.520
Lord Munto!

15:56.520 --> 15:57.230
Munto!

15:57.230 --> 15:58.790
Thank goodness you're all right!

15:58.790 --> 16:00.030
So she's the girl?

16:00.030 --> 16:00.880
Yeah.

16:04.680 --> 16:07.890
She's the girl who released us from the Akuto crisis a year ago...

16:09.850 --> 16:15.600
Who would've guessed that this fair
princess possessed such amazing powers.

16:15.600 --> 16:18.090
You have our gratitude, little girl.

16:18.090 --> 16:21.740
We magicians welcome you from the bottom of our hearts.

16:25.140 --> 16:31.830
That crazy outsider Gass used Munto to break through the gate of space and time...

16:31.830 --> 16:34.330
...just to summon that little girl?

16:35.410 --> 16:36.500
How pathetic.

16:40.470 --> 16:42.090
Here it comes! It's Gridori!

16:48.940 --> 16:50.330
Protect the girl!

17:10.160 --> 17:13.820
Louie, take Yumemi back to the Magical Kingdom first.

17:13.820 --> 17:14.740
Be careful.

17:14.740 --> 17:16.840
He has already defeated the Outsider Gass...

17:16.840 --> 17:17.910
I know.

17:17.910 --> 17:18.750
Lord Munto!

17:21.910 --> 17:22.610
Let's go!

17:32.480 --> 17:34.610
Level of remaining thrust Akuto: blue.

17:34.610 --> 17:36.040
Engines, nominal.

17:36.040 --> 17:38.020
Route set to Union Headquarters.

17:39.160 --> 17:44.530
Munto, don't you lose that girl.

18:00.980 --> 18:02.880
Listen, Gridori.

18:02.880 --> 18:05.090
Now is not the time to be fighting.

18:05.460 --> 18:10.140
Don't worry, I'll save this world...

18:10.140 --> 18:12.890
...because I'm the only king of the Heavens!

18:16.300 --> 18:17.140
Munto!

18:17.690 --> 18:19.850
Please, take me back! Munto is...

18:20.820 --> 18:22.480
They're too fast; they're catching up!

18:22.480 --> 18:24.400
Marty! Harka! Tail!

18:25.110 --> 18:26.620
We'll stay here and buy them time.

18:27.410 --> 18:28.650
Don't let even one through.

18:28.820 --> 18:29.830
Roger that!

18:42.090 --> 18:43.470
I'll...

18:54.210 --> 18:56.180
Such hard bodies!

19:47.000 --> 19:48.830
Gass! Gass!

19:48.830 --> 19:50.650
It's me, Irita!

19:51.020 --> 19:52.160
Get a hold of yourself!

19:52.610 --> 19:54.740
I'm coming to save you right now!

20:04.330 --> 20:07.470
Hurry up and save the Outsider!

20:19.270 --> 20:20.390
There are too many!

20:23.430 --> 20:24.730
Shit, they got past!

20:27.720 --> 20:29.400
Tail, I'll leave this you!

20:42.820 --> 20:44.870
Munto... Everyone...

20:49.620 --> 20:51.840
This is all you've got?

20:53.430 --> 20:55.060
I don't get it.

20:55.060 --> 20:58.800
Why did the previous king leave the future in your hands?

21:00.010 --> 21:03.200
Why did he leave it to such a weak thing?

21:03.200 --> 21:06.270
Why won't anyone recognize my strength?

21:08.380 --> 21:09.770
Don't you get it?

21:17.130 --> 21:20.530
It's because you don't have anything you want to protect.

21:22.550 --> 21:24.280
Protect?

21:24.280 --> 21:26.540
What is there to protect?

21:27.460 --> 21:30.290
Ever since ancient times, we Heavenly beings...

21:30.570 --> 21:36.710
...have always taken whatever we wanted from the weaklings in space-time.

21:37.430 --> 21:41.690
We've taken their futures and dreams... We let none of it go.

21:41.690 --> 21:46.420
Have we not been taking from the lower world until there was nothing left?

21:46.420 --> 21:48.690
So why mention "protect" now?

21:49.260 --> 21:51.030
Don't make me laugh,

21:51.030 --> 21:54.860
the successor of the Heavens, the lord of all magic!

22:06.870 --> 22:07.870
Hey, Jill!

22:08.430 --> 22:10.040
What are you doing? Cover us!

22:10.280 --> 22:11.630
That's too much!

22:11.630 --> 22:15.040
I'm already shielding you guys, I can't cover you any more!

22:17.340 --> 22:20.380
Leica, I'll be the bait. Use that chance-

22:21.710 --> 22:22.840
Gass, no!

22:22.840 --> 22:24.210
You can't move yet!

22:24.210 --> 22:27.600
Don't worry, I'm an Outsider, after all.

22:29.900 --> 22:32.190
But your body is...

22:44.740 --> 22:47.370
Don't go, Gass!

22:51.620 --> 22:53.520
Gass!

24:31.450 --> 24:32.760
Don't act tough when you can't win.

24:32.760 --> 24:33.770
What's wrong, Irita?

24:33.770 --> 24:35.860
A kid shouldn't say something like that.

24:35.860 --> 24:36.980
But you can't win.

24:36.980 --> 24:39.560
That's not true, I'm trying my best, you know.

24:39.560 --> 24:41.350
I'm even wearing a t-shirt in winter.

24:41.350 --> 24:42.450
She's talking about the Magical King.

24:42.450 --> 24:44.200
Me?!

24:44.200 --> 24:47.420
Next episode of The World Reflected in the Eyes of a Girl who Looks Up at the Sky:

24:47.420 --> 24:48.470
Forgiveness.
